            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>CC-10004, a phosphodiesterase 4 inhibitor and selective cytokine inhibitor, is under development by Celgene for the potential treatment of asthma, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, inflammation and psoriasis. By October 2004, phase II trials in psoriasis had commenced.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
